===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# [[river|River]] in southern [[England]] flowing 336 [[km]] (209 [[mile|mi.]]) through [[London]] to the [[North Sea]].
# A [[sea area]] centred on the [[Thames Estuary]]
# [[river|River]] in [[Ontario]] province, [[Canada]], flowing 258 [[km]] (160 [[mile|mi.]]) to [[Lake St. Clair]].
# [[river|River]] in the U.S. State of [[Connecticut]] flowing 24 [[km]] (15 [[mile|mi.]]) past [[New London]] to [[Long Island Sound]].
# A town in the [[North Island]] of [[New Zealand]], situated on the [[firth|Firth]] of Thames (a large bay) and the [[Coromandel]] Peninsula. {{topics|en|New Zealand}}
# {{surname|lang=en}}

